ass=\"ce\">H<sub>2</sub>O<sub>2</sub></span> est-il stable ?</li><li><span class=\"num\">56</span> <span class=\"ce\">Fe<sup>2<sup>+</sup></sup></span> : <span class=\"m\">E<sup>°</sup></span>(<span class=\"ce\">Fe<sup>3<sup>+</sup></sup></span>/<span class=\"ce\">Fe<sup>2<sup>+</sup></sup></span>) = 0,77 V ; <span class=\"m\">E<sup>°</sup></span>(<span class=\"ce\">Fe<sup>2<sup>+</sup></sup></span>/<span class=\"ce\">Fe</span>) = -0,44 V (pH = 0), <span class=\"ce\">Fe<sup>2<sup>+</sup></sup></span> est-il stable ?</li></ul> ","corrige":"<p class=\"q\">Si le domaine de <span class=\"ce\">X</span> disparaît (frontières croisées), <span class=\"ce\">X</span> se dismute :</p><ul class=\"en\"><li><span class=\"num\">45</span> <span class=\"m\">E<sup>°</sup></span>(<span class=\"ce\">Cl<sub>2</sub></span>/<span class=\"ce\">Cl<sup>−</sup></span>) <span class=\"m\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"m\">E<sup>°</sup></span>(<span class=\"ce\">HClO</span>/<span class=\"ce\">Cl<sub>2</sub></span>) : <span class=\"ce\">Cl<sub>2</sub></span> est <b>stable</b> ; <span class=\"ce\">HClO</span> et <span class=\"ce\">Cl<sup>−</sup></span> réagissent par <b>médiamutation</b> pour donner <span class=\"ce\">Cl<sub>2</sub></span></li><li><span class=\"num\">46</span> <span class=\"m\">E<sup>°</sup></span>(<span class=\"ce\">Sn<sup>2<sup>+</sup></sup></span>/<span class=\"ce\">Sn</span>) <span class=\"m\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"m\">E<sup>°</sup></span>(<span class=\"ce\">Sn<sup>4<sup>+</sup></sup></span>/<span class=\"ce\">Sn<sup>2<sup>+</sup></sup></span>) : <span class=\"ce\">Sn<sup>2<sup>+</sup></sup></span> est <b>stable</b> ; <span class=\"ce\">Sn<sup>4<sup>+</sup></sup></span> et <span class=\"ce\">Sn</span> réagissent par <b>médiamutation</b> pour donner <span class=\"ce\">Sn<sup>2<sup>+</sup></sup></span></li><li><span class=\"num\">47</span> <span class=\"m\">E<sup>°</sup></span>(<span class=\"ce\">Cu<sup><sup>+</sup></sup></span>/<span class=\"ce\">Cu</span>) <span class=\"m\">&g